"负责启动、停止并监督 macOS 的系统服务和用户服务。" = "Starts, stops, and supervises macOS system and user services.";
"窗口与图形服务" = "Window and Graphics Service";
"合成屏幕上的窗口、动画与显示内容；高负载通常与窗口、显示器或图形更新有关。" = "Composites onscreen windows, animations, and display content. Higher load often accompanies window, display, or graphics updates.";
