"提供桌面、Dock、菜单栏、控制中心或通知等系统界面。" = "Provides system UI such as the desktop, Dock, menu bar, Control Center, and notifications.";
"Spotlight 索引" = "Spotlight Indexing";
"扫描文件内容并更新搜索索引；新文件、代码仓库或外接磁盘可能触发持续读写。" = "Scans file contents and updates the search index. New files, code repositories, or external disks can trigger ongoing reads and writes.";
"云端与文件同步" = "Cloud and File Sync";
"在本机与 iCloud 或文件提供商之间同步内容，可能产生下载、上传和磁盘写入。" = "Syncs content between this Mac and iCloud or file providers, which can generate downloads, uploads, and disk writes.";
"Time Machine 备份" = "Time Machine Backup";
"扫描变化并写入备份目标；备份期间持续读取和写入通常属于预期行为。" = "Scans for changes and writes them to the backup destination. Ongoing reads and writes are usually expected during a backup.";
"照片与媒体分析" = "Photo and Media Analysis";
"分析照片或媒体内容并维护资料库索引，可能阶段性占用 CPU 和磁盘。" = "Analyzes photos or media and maintains library indexes, which can temporarily use CPU and disk resources.";
"存储空间分析" = "Storage Analysis";
"扫描应用与文件以计算存储占用；分析期间可能出现较高 CPU 与磁盘读取。" = "Scans apps and files to calculate storage use. CPU usage and disk reads may rise during analysis.";
"系统安全服务" = "System Security Service";
"处理隐私授权、证书信任、代码签名或安全策略验证。" = "Handles privacy authorization, certificate trust, code signing, and security policy checks.";
"系统音频服务" = "System Audio Service";
"管理音频设备、混音和应用音频流。" = "Manages audio devices, mixing, and app audio streams.";
"系统网络服务" = "System Network Service";
"负责网络配置、设备发现、推送或共享连接。" = "Handles network configuration, device discovery, push delivery, or shared connections.";
"macOS 后台服务" = "macOS Background Service";
"维护文件事件、日志、偏好设置、进程生命周期或电源调度。" = "Maintains file events, logs, preferences, process lifecycles, or power scheduling.";
"AI 开发工具" = "AI Development Tool";
"运行对话、代码分析、索引或 agent 任务；处理大型工作区时可能持续使用 CPU、网络和磁盘。" = "Runs conversations, code analysis, indexing, or agent tasks. Large workspaces can keep CPU, network, and disk resources active.";
"开发与构建工具" = "Development and Build Tool";
"执行编译、代码分析、依赖处理或脚本任务；构建期间的高 CPU 与写入通常是阶段性的。" = "Runs compilation, code analysis, dependency processing, or scripts. Higher CPU usage and writes are often temporary during builds.";
"应用辅助进程" = "App Helper Process";
"为网页或桌面应用提供渲染、网络、GPU 或后台任务；同一应用通常会启动多个辅助进程。" = "Provides rendering, networking, GPU work, or background tasks for a web or desktop app. One app commonly starts several helpers.";
"用户应用" = "User App";
"这是已安装应用或其辅助进程；当前资源值汇总到所属应用。" = "This is an installed app or one of its helpers. Current resource values are grouped under the owning app.";
"macOS 系统进程" = "macOS System Process";
"这是由 macOS 提供的后台进程；具体用途可结合可执行路径继续判断。" = "This is a background process provided by macOS. Its executable path can help identify its specific purpose.";
"命令行进程" = "Command-Line Process";
"无法仅凭名称可靠确定用途；可执行路径是判断来源和功能的主要依据。" = "Its purpose cannot be determined reliably from the name alone. The executable path is the best indicator of its origin and function.";
"多项资源同时活跃" = "Multiple Resources Active";
"该进程正在同时使用计算、磁盘或网络资源；请结合下方实时值判断任务类型。" = "This process is using more than one of CPU, disk, and network resources. Use the live values below to assess the type of work.";
"CPU 负载很高" = "Very High CPU Load";
"最近 5 秒至少占满一个逻辑核心；并行任务超过 100% 属于 macOS 的正常计量方式。" = "Over the last 5 seconds, usage was equivalent to at least one fully occupied logical core. Parallel work can normally exceed 100% on macOS.";
"CPU 负载较高" = "High CPU Load";
"当前存在明显的计算任务，但是否异常取决于它是否持续以及是否符合你的操作。" = "There is notable compute activity. Whether it is unusual depends on how long it lasts and whether it matches what you are doing.";
"磁盘写入很高" = "Very High Disk Write Rate";
"正在持续产生大量数据；构建、下载、同步和缓存任务都可能出现这种负载。" = "Write throughput has been high over the last 5 seconds. Builds, downloads, syncs, and caching can produce this load.";
"磁盘写入活跃" = "Disk Writes Active";
"当前有明确写入活动；持续时间比单次峰值更能说明是否异常。" = "There is clear write activity. Its duration is more useful than a single peak when deciding whether it is unusual.";
"磁盘读取活跃" = "Disk Reads Active";
"当前正在扫描或载入较多数据，常见于索引、分析、构建和应用启动。" = "The process is scanning or loading data at a notable rate, which is common during indexing, analysis, builds, and app launch.";
"网络传输活跃" = "Network Transfer Active";
"当前有明显下载或上传；磁盘写入可能来自下载、同步或缓存。" = "There is notable download or upload activity. Concurrent disk writes may come from downloads, syncing, or caching.";
"当前有轻度活动" = "Light Activity";
"资源使用处于较低水平，暂未表现出持续高负载。" = "Resource use is currently low, with no sign of a sustained high load.";
"当前接近空闲" = "Nearly Idle";
